codex
DONE: both wrapper fixes and all requested model-facing descriptions are complete.

Description changes

- `graph_related_functions`: “opseq analogs” → “instruction-shape analogs, callers, callees, data references, and corroborating xrefs.”
- `source_permuter_run`: “expensive last-resort search” → bounded named-function mutation probe returning one scalar score and source diff; instruction deltas require `checkdiff_run`.
- `source_permuter_replay`: “expensive last-resort replay” → saved-recipe replay returning its score and source diff; instruction deltas require `checkdiff_run`.
- `mwcc_alloc_snapshot`: generic allocator evidence → GPR coloring only, no FPR coloring; before/after are stages of one compile.
- `mwcc_alloc_compare`: generic snapshot comparison → GPR coloring only, no FPR coloring; not candidate versus target.
- `mwcc_debug_diagnose_regflow`: generic register-flow diagnosis → one compact register-only window, not full liveness or FPR coloring.
- `checkdiff_run`: generic focused diff → documents the 24-row limit, row kind, target/current sides, and strict relocation/data caveat.
- `direct_compile_tu`: function-or-unit description → explicitly says, “Pass exactly one of `function` or `unit`.”
- `kv2_attempt_search`: generic attempt history → accepts a stable target key or text query and returns summaries and observations with hits.

Fixes

1. `direct_compile_tu` now forwards only `function` when both selectors are supplied. Its result includes `note: "unit was ignored because function implies the unit."`
2. `source_permuter_run` now promotes function lookup and source parsing failures to top-level `status: "failed"` with a `reason`.

Files changed

- `apps/server/src/core/tools/metadata/{capabilities,knowledge,knowledge-v2}.ts`
- `apps/server/src/core/tools/wrappers/{capabilities,knowledge,knowledge-v2}.ts`
- `apps/server/src/core/tools/wrappers/capability-result-normalization.test.ts`

`direct_compile.py` required no change.

Tests added

- Direct compile selector precedence and result note.
- Permuter function-not-found and source-parse failure promotion.

Validation

- `cd apps/server && bun test src/core/tools`
- 49 passed, 0 failed, 229 assertions.
